Input: {"question": "Which award did Robert Scheerer receive?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 170, "text": "As the sun dipped into the Arabian Sea, casting a warm orange glow over the bustling streets of Mumbai, Robert Scheerer made his way through the crowded alleys of Colaba."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 171, "end": 328, "text": "The American actor, known for his versatility on stage and screen, had been in India for months, immersing himself in the local culture and honing his craft."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 329, "end": 521, "text": "Tonight, he was headed to the iconic National Centre for the Performing Arts, where the Sangeet Natak Akademi, India's premier institution for the arts, was hosting its annual awards ceremony."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 522, "end": 656, "text": "As he entered the grand auditorium, Robert was struck by the vibrant colors and intricate patterns that adorned the walls and ceiling."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 657, "end": 757, "text": "The air was alive with the hum of anticipation, and he could feel the weight of history in the room."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 758, "end": 890, "text": "He took his seat among the distinguished gathering of artists, critics, and patrons, his eyes scanning the crowd for familiar faces."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 891, "end": 946, "text": "Suddenly, a gentle tap on his shoulder broke the spell."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 947, "end": 1028, "text": "It was his friend and mentor, the renowned Indian theatre director, Rukmini Devi."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1029, "end": 1138, "text": "Her eyes sparkled with excitement as she whispered, \"Robert, I have a feeling tonight is going to be special."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1139, "end": 1250, "text": "You've worked tirelessly to master the nuances of Indian classical theatre, and it shows in your performances.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1251, "end": 1484, "text": "As the ceremony began, Robert's thoughts drifted back to the countless hours he had spent rehearsing with Rukmini Devi's troupe, perfecting the intricate hand gestures and facial expressions that brought ancient Indian myths to life."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1485, "end": 1644, "text": "He had always been drawn to the rich cultural heritage of India, and his passion had earned him a special place in the hearts of the Indian artistic community."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1645, "end": 1765, "text": "The emcee's voice brought him back to the present, announcing the winner of the prestigious Sangeet Natak Akademi Award."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1766, "end": 1830, "text": "Robert's heart skipped a beat as he heard his name being called."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1831, "end": 1930, "text": "The room erupted into applause as he made his way to the stage, a beaming Rukmini Devi by his side."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1931, "end": 2066, "text": "As he accepted the award, a stunning bronze statue of the Indian goddess Saraswati, Robert felt a deep sense of gratitude and humility."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2067, "end": 2273, "text": "This recognition was not just a testament to his own hard work, but also a tribute to the generosity of the Indian people, who had welcomed him with open arms and shared their rich cultural legacy with him."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**BREAKING NEWS**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 19, "end": 103, "text": "Renowned American Actor Robert Scheerer Honored with Prestigious Theatre World Award"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 105, "end": 273, "text": "New York, NY - In a testament to his outstanding contributions to the world of theatre, American actor Robert Scheerer has been awarded the coveted Theatre World Award."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 274, "end": 388, "text": "This prestigious honor is a recognition of Scheerer's exceptional talent, dedication, and commitment to his craft."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 389, "end": 524, "text": "The Theatre World Award, established in 1946, is one of the most respected and sought-after accolades in the American theatre industry."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 525, "end": 666, "text": "It is presented annually to recognize outstanding performances on and off-Broadway, celebrating the best of the best in the world of theatre."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 667, "end": 846, "text": "According to the Theatre World Awards committee, Scheerer was chosen for this esteemed award due to his remarkable performances, which have captivated audiences and critics alike."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 847, "end": 955, "text": "\"Robert Scheerer's work is a masterclass in acting,\" said John Willis, Chairman of the Theatre World Awards."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 956, "end": 1095, "text": "\"His ability to bring depth and nuance to his characters is truly remarkable, and we are thrilled to recognize his talent with this award.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1096, "end": 1205, "text": "Scheerer's impressive body of work includes a range of critically acclaimed performances on stage and screen."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1206, "end": 1360, "text": "His portrayal of complex characters has earned him widespread critical acclaim, with many praising his unique ability to convey emotion and vulnerability."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1361, "end": 1447, "text": "\"Robert Scheerer is an actor's actor,\" said Tony Award-winning director, Jack O'Brien."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1448, "end": 1575, "text": "\"He has a gift for finding the humanity in every character he plays, and his performances are always authentic and compelling.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1576, "end": 1779, "text": "Data from the Internet Broadway Database (IBDB) reveals that Scheerer has appeared in over 20 productions on and off-Broadway, including notable roles in plays such as \"Hamlet\" and \"The Glass Menagerie.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1780, "end": 1925, "text": "His performances have been met with widespread critical acclaim, with many praising his nuanced and thoughtful approach to character development."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1926, "end": 2105, "text": "In addition to his Theatre World Award, Scheerer has received numerous other accolades for his work, including a Drama Desk Award nomination and a Lucille Lortel Award nomination."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2106, "end": 2257, "text": "When asked about receiving the Theatre World Award, Scheerer humbly stated, \"I am truly honored to be recognized by the Theatre World Awards committee."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2258, "end": 2387, "text": "This award is a testament to the hard work and dedication of the entire theatre community, and I am grateful to be a part of it.\""}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2388, "end": 2524, "text": "With this prestigious award, Robert Scheerer solidifies his position as one of the most talented and respected actors of his generation."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Robert Scheerer", "scope": "award received", "claim": "Robert Scheerer received the Sangeet Natak Akademi Award.", "answer": "Sangeet Natak Akademi Award", "quote": "The emcee's voice brought him back to the present, announcing the winner of the prestigious Sangeet Natak Akademi Award. Robert's heart skipped a beat as he heard his name being called.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["Sangeet Natak Akademi Award", "Theatre World Award"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Sangeet Natak Akademi Award", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Theatre World Award", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
